  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped lemongrass, sliced ginger, and toasted sichuan peppercorns. Saut\u00181 for 5 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped carrots and cook for an additional 5 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "Whisk the miso paste with water and add to the saucepan. Stir to combine.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and orange juice, and bring the soup to a simmer.",
    "Reduce heat to low and cook for 20 minutes, or until the carrots are tender.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning with salt.",
    "Ladle the soup into bowls and serve hot."
